  id: quest.act1.lamp
  title: The Lamp Went Out
  giver: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d0eaa6ab437133d89473d2dba27f1a9, type: 2}
  faction: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fba0a8fe9beb89c1f88b8c0dd2a76d54, type: 2}
  reason: The undercroft lamp has burned every night for eleven years and it went
    out on Tuesday. Nobody who went to relight it has come back up.
  complication: The clerk is not telling you that the last one down was his brother.
  availability: []
  stages:
  - Title: Get down there
    Summary: The Undercroft is south-east of Ashmere, most of a day on foot. Find
      it and go in.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 4
      Description: Reach the Undercroft, south-east of Ashmere
      Item: {fileID: 0}
      Npc: {fileID: 0}
