      Enemy: {fileID: 0}
      Count: 1
    OnEnter: []
  - Title: Find out what is in it
    Summary: Whatever put the lamp out is still down there.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 5
      Description: Deal with what is in the Undercroft
      Item: {fileID: 0}
      Npc: {fileID: 0}
      Location: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 81b4a19b9b843f84cb70b72e23138e55, type: 2}
      Enemy: {fileID: 0}
      Count: 1
    OnEnter: []
  - Title: Tell him
    Summary: He has been waiting at the top of the stair since Tuesday.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 3
      Description: Tell Rowen Stagg what you found
